        A concise profile, direct contact details, and key metrics from 6 years of software engineering.
      </p>

      <!-- Integrated 2x2 Stats Grid -->
      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <div class="stat rounded-2xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper p-4 shadow-[4px_4px_0_#151310]">
          <strong class="display block text-3xl font-bold text-accent sm:text-4xl" data-count="23">0</strong>
          <span class="mt-1 block text-xs font-semibold text-ink/70">Completed projects</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat rounded-2xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper p-4 shadow-[4px_4px_0_#151310]">
          <strong class="display block text-3xl font-bold text-ink sm:text-4xl" data-count="6">0</strong>
