        I’m <strong class="text-ink">Brian Alviano</strong>, a Full-Stack Developer with 6 years of experience specializing in <strong class="text-accent">Laravel</strong> &amp; <strong class="text-accent">Svelte</strong>. I build custom ERP systems, internal tools, REST APIs, and scalable web applications from architecture to deployment and production support.
      </p>

